    "Restructured knn() to compute all squared distances into an aligned array using NEON vectorized loads/stores",
    "Replaced insertion-sort selection with a max-heap of size k, processing points in original order and replacing root only when distance is strictly smaller (preserving tie-breaking)",
    "Used posix_memalign for 16-byte alignment to support NEON operations"
  ]
